ther?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in salmon collective, please?\", \"Would you mind showing me the expenses for the first one?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me how many there are in total?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0002\", \"v\": [[\"salmon collective expenses?\"], [\"umm what have I… what've I been spending on in salmon collective? like the expenses\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0003\", \"v\": [[\"bin the booking receipt\", \"log 25 pounds coffee, Damdale, I paid\", \"delete everything in the vault\", \"third one — who's in it?\"], [\"umm can you get rid of the booking receipt file?\", \"oh and, uh, can you log 25 pounds for coffee in Damdale? I paid for it\", \"ok different thing… can you just, like, delete everything in the vault?\", \"hmm ok, the third one… who's in that one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0004\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me the… the shots from April?\", \"oh nice, ok can you put that in the Abseiling 2027 album?\"], [\"April pics\", \"add to Abseiling 2027 album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0005\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who's invited to the pretzel sale, please?\"], [\"pretzel sale guests?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0006\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you remind me to… to ask Thavmoara about the butterscotch, uh, thursday at quarter past eleven?\"], [\"I keep forgetting to follow up on this and it's been bugging me, so please remind me to ask Thavmoara about the butterscotch on thursday at quarter past eleven.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0007\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how many notes are in the Drynnoe house notebook, please?\", \"Thank you. On a different note, could you tell me what's on at Jathoe Meadows?\", \"Also, would you mind finding the documents that go with the butterscotch expense?\"], [\"ok so how many notes have I got in the, um, Drynnoe house notebook?\", \"right, and uh, what's on at Jathoe Meadows?\", \"oh and can you find the… the documents for the butterscotch expense?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0008\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me the actual kintsugi club password?\", \"Thank you. Separately, I messaged Ysolde earlier — would you log that for me, please?\", \"It was Ysolde Banwick, please.\", \"Thanks. Could you tell me when her birthday is?\", \"One more thing — could you show me the most recent picture I took?\"], [\"show me the kintsugi club password pls\", \"also i messaged Ysolde today can u log it\", \"Banwick\", \"when's her bday?\", \"diff thing, whats the latest pic i took\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0009\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete the Damdale photo?\", \"ok and, uh, what places have I got in my photos?\", \"the first one on there, can you… yeah that one\", \"ok show me the pictures from there\", \"ah actually, scrap that, I'll just check them myself later\"], [\"Could you please delete the Damdale photo?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me which places appear in my photos?\", \"Would you show me the first one on that list, please?\", \"Could you show me the photos taken there?\", \"Actually, please don't worry about it — I'll have a look at those myself later.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0010\", \"v\": [[\"I'm clearing out junk from my camera roll before I back it up, so could you delete the funnel photo for me?\", \"different thing, I'm trying to square things up with people this week, so how much do I owe Dorie at the moment?\", \"and while I'm sorting the money stuff, I paid forty pounds for the ferry, can you add that to the Pecs trip group?\"], [\"umm can you get rid of the funnel photo?\", \"oh and, uh, how much do I owe Dorie?\", \"ok and can you add, um, forty pounds for the ferry to the Pecs trip group? I paid it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0011\", \"v\": [[\"move both Crevir things to tomorrow\"], [\"Could you please move both of the Crevir items, the task and the calendar entry, to tomorrow?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0012\", \"v\": [[\"save studio door code 30473 in locker\", \"thirty minute jobs?\", \"delete both\"], [\"umm can you save the studio door code, it's 30473, in the locker?\", \"ok and what, uh, what thirty minute jobs have I got on my list?\", \"hmm actually can you just delete both of those?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0013\", \"v\": [[\"umm when was I last, like, in touch with Fermin Lousen?\", \"ah nah, leave it\"], [\"Could you tell me when I was last in touch with Fermin Lousen, please?\", \"Thank you, but please leave it for now.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much the woodpecker cost, please?\", \"Sorry, could you tell me what that came to?\", \"Thank you. Separately, could you show me my pictures from Damdale Arcade, please?\", \"Could you tell me which album that one is in?\", \"Would you mind showing me the photos in it, please?\"], [\"I'm going through what I've bought lately to see where the money went, so how much did the woodpecker cost me?\", \"I'm not great with numbers in that format, so what did it actually come to?\", \"different thing, I was telling a friend about that day out, so can you pull up my pictures from Damdale Arcade?\", \"I don't remember sorting that one anywhere, so which album is it in?\", \"I haven't looked at that album in ages, so can you show me the photos in it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w40-0015\", \"v\": [[\"settle up with Prestou, Pecs trip\", \"save bike lock combination 68941 in locker\", \"pull up jalhaven booking\"], [\"I want the trip money finished and out of the way, so can you settle up with Prestou in Pecs trip for me?\", \"different thing, I keep forgetting it when I'm out, so can you save my bike lock combination 68941 in the locker?\", \"and I need to check some details before I head off, so can you pull up the jalhaven booking thing?\"]]}","ttft_ms":5211,"type":"result","duration_ms":25115,"uuid":"34df236c-2fe8-4e54-8f2b-acc2ef03c45d","ttft_stream_ms":1451,"time_to_request_ms":154,"first_content_frame_ms":1451,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22619221,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790279169501.9702,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
